---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Agricultural Finance, Grants & Machinery Resources | GoOrganicAfrica
description: Find structured agricultural finance, grants, machinery, equipment and marketplace resources for African farmers and agribusinesses.
permalink: "/agriculture-resources/"
---
<section class="section" style="padding-top:48px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
    <span class="eyebrow"><span data-i18n="static.resources.eyebrow">Farmer Resources</span></span>
    <h1>Agricultural Finance, Grants & Machinery</h1>
    <p class="lede"><span data-i18n="static.resources.resourcesIntro">A structured resource centre for finding agricultural funding, grant opportunities, machinery, equipment and related services. Listings are intended to be verified and maintained through the GoOrganicAfrica CMS.</span></p>
    <div class="resource-language" style="margin-top:24px;">
  <label for="resource-language-select" class="visually-hidden">Language</label>
  <select id="site-language-select" class="site-language-select" aria-label="Language" data-goa-selector-section="agriculture-resources">
    {% for lang in siteLanguages.languages %}
    {% if lang.enabled != false %}<option value="{{ lang.code }}"{% if (language or "en") == lang.code %} selected{% endif %}>{{ lang.native }}</option>{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </select>
</div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:32px;">
      <a class="ebook-card" href="/agricultural-finance/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2>Agricultural Finance</h2><p><span data-i18n="static.resources.financeCardText">Loans, insurance, input finance, equipment finance, leasing and other agricultural funding routes.</span></p></a>
      <a class="ebook-card" href="/agricultural-grants/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2><span data-i18n="static.resources.grantsCardTitle">Grants & Opportunities</span></h2><p><span data-i18n="static.resources.grantsCardText">Grants, subsidies, competitions, youth and women programmes, training and other opportunities.</span></p></a>
      <a class="ebook-card" href="/farm-machinery/" style="text-decoration:none;"><h2><span data-i18n="static.resources.machineryCardTitle">Farm Machinery</span></h2><p><span data-i18n="static.resources.machineryCardText">Tractors, planters, harvesters, irrigation, processing, greenhouse and other farm equipment.</span></p></a>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:36px;">
      <h2>Africa-wide directory</h2>
      <p>Coverage framework: <strong>{{ agriculturalResources.countries | length }} African countries</strong>. Each country will use the same verified record structure for finance, grants, machinery and other agricultural resources.</p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:18px;">
        {% for country in agriculturalResources.countries %}
        <div style="padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;">
          <strong>{{ country.flag }} {{ country.name }}</strong>
          <div style="font-size:.85rem;opacity:.75;margin-top:4px;">Official resources being verified</div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:36px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;">
      <h2><span data-i18n="static.resources.verifyTitle">Verification matters</span></h2>
      <p><span data-i18n="static.resources.verifyText">Funding and equipment offers can change, close or have eligibility restrictions. GoOrganicAfrica will publish active directory records only when their verification status is suitable for public display, with official source links and verification dates where available.</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>